                                                "sense_id": "4e2fae19-e57c-3cf5-8b4a-52163adce76b",
                                                "text": "By now South Koreans understand Pyongyang’s logic and know North Korea is highly unlikely to make good on its gothic threats."
                                            }
                                        ]
